      <groundspeak:logs>
        <groundspeak:log id="1270828118">
          <groundspeak:date>2024-11-16T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="25790230">MaybeSunshine</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP561 Glenbow Ranch Vista [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stopped here after a quick trip to Cochrane. I couldn’t find anything readable on the cap, but it was definitely the cap! TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684622143">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-05T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="6304346">sapien</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP561 Glenbow Ranch Vista

N 51° 10.857 W 114° 25.396&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I think the toughest problem is trying to figure out how to get to the cap.  I managed to find a path though I wasn't sure if I, as just a walker, was supposed to be on it.  I chanced it and I never ran into any muggles thankfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What a view at GZ!  I was glad to see the cap was well marked; otherwise this could have been an interesting find, I suspect.  TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683864383">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-05T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="7573673">geoCurious2</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP561 - Glenbow Ranch Vista&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having discovered that we actually had a few more days to record Brass Caps, we went out today to get some more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across the river and into GlenEagles for a short walk for this find.  What a view!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684223507">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-03T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3061435">Iron Phoenix</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP561 - Glenbow Ranch Vista&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, picking up ones we didn't get to earlier! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; A busy day today and lots of walking, but a lot of fun!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; Definitely a great view!!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; It took us a while to find access, but eventually we found a nice short walk that the geodog enjoy accompanying us on, and we found the cap in short order.  What a view!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683848497">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-03T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="540154">One Bad Ant</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP561 - Glenbow Ranch Vista - we parked at the Golf Cart Crossing and enjoyed our short walk to the cache. The views are truly amazing from here. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iron Phoenix and I spent the day continuing our Calgary and area capping spree. Thanks for the work you do maintaining the caps outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
      </groundspeak:logs>
